<title>SINGAPORE: FELS appoints new executive director.</title>
<headline>FELS appoints new executive director.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Far East Levingston Shipbuilding said on Thursday that Tong Chong Heong has returned to the company as Executive Director, effective from November 16.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement, Tong will report directly to Deputy Chairman/Managing Director Choo Chiau Beng.</p>
<p>Tong's last post was as Managing Director at Keppel Cairncross Shipyard, Brisbane, part of the Keppel Group's network of shipyards.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65-870-3082)</p>
</text>
